{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26021","headline":"题吴徵君岩居 · 鲍溶","name":"题吴徵君岩居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尧泽润天下，许由心不知。\n真风存绵緜，常与达者期。\n有道吾不仕，有生吾不欺。\n澹然灵府中，独见太古时。\n地脉发醴泉，岩根生灵芝。\n天文若通会，星影应离离。\n亭亭傅氏岩，何独万古思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26021.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26021","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}